<!--
  ZA.Mediator v6.0.0 - intentional API breaks for the major version bump.

  The v1.x IServiceCollection registration shims have been [Obsolete] since 2.0 under ZAMED001 to
  ZAMED003, documented as "will be removed in the next major". 6.0 removes them. Each one has a
  direct replacement on the IMediatorBuilder that AddMediator() returns; docs/migrating-to-v6.md
  maps every old name to its replacement.

  Generated by apicompat in suppression-file mode against the 5.1.5 baseline of each package, then
  annotated. The 3.0.0 IMediatorBuilder.Create and Mediator.Authorization 2.0.0 entries were
  dropped: against the 5.1.5 baseline they are unnecessary. Only the removed shims are listed, so
  an accidental removal elsewhere still fails the job.

  Diagnostic-ID reference:
  https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/fundamentals/package-validation/diagnostic-ids
-->
