    <Right>lib/net10.0/ZeroAlloc.Mediator.Cache.dll</Right>
    <IsBaselineSuppression>true</IsBaselineSuppression>
    <Justification>ZAMED001, obsolete since 2.0, removed in 6.0. Replacement: services.AddMediator().WithCache().</Justification>
